        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "8cbcf11c-735d-3be8-b5f2-a811fc1c5389",
                "word": "lapalissade",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "34a72ccd-9a0d-4428-ad25-6f8176cf1099",
                        "entry_id": "8cbcf11c-735d-3be8-b5f2-a811fc1c5389",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "lapalissades"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "aa9ad3eb-493f-3ab5-8b5c-1abb08f8d6df",
                        "entry_id": "8cbcf11c-735d-3be8-b5f2-a811fc1c5389",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Chose évidente, tautologique, réflexion niaise ou ridicule tant elle est évidente, et à laquelle vous répondez : « La Palice en aurait dit autant ! »"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "rhetoric"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "93c436fe-f260-4f27-b3a5-3c1ff9021134",
                                "sense_id": "aa9ad3eb-493f-3ab5-8b5c-1abb08f8d6df",
                                "text": "Le comédien n'est pas une machine. C'est une lapalissade qu'il est bon de crier à tue-tête. Le comédien n'est pas un pion, un robot."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f979fe6c-db2f-450e-9457-6dc76b5aae34",
                                "sense_id": "aa9ad3eb-493f-3ab5-8b5c-1abb08f8d6df",
                                "text": "La question demeure donc entière. Je me la suis posée dans tous les sens pour arriver à une conclusion en forme de lapalissade : s’il est resté aussi longtemps, c’est peut-être tout simplement parce qu’il n’est pas parti…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1b5d3275-f044-4b64-b3f8-261b495bc5d8",
                                "sense_id": "aa9ad3eb-493f-3ab5-8b5c-1abb08f8d6df",
                                "text": "Commençons par une lapalissade : les Jeux olympiques et paralympiques (JOP), c’est beaucoup plus que du sport."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d29dc66c-adda-4aa8-97eb-3b577eeb81b0",
                        "source_entry_id": "8cbcf11c-735d-3be8-b5f2-a811fc1c5389",
                        "source_sense_id": "aa9ad3eb-493f-3ab5-8b5c-1abb08f8d6df",
                        "target_lang_word": "Binsenweisheit",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Binsenweisheit",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b707161f-ee92-391e-b82e-9efc5a51058a",
                                        "entry_id": "820a9e53-9f7a-39fa-a5eb-14528d7d38ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "allgemein bekannte Tatsache"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ccddb327-91e3-4dcb-b240-4a7ed9504c17",
                                                "sense_id": "b707161f-ee92-391e-b82e-9efc5a51058a",
                                                "text": "Es ist eine Binsenweisheit, dass Pflanzen zum Gedeihen Licht brauchen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "089ba0c9-2e05-4abc-9db5-f9fa2c987d2a",
                                                "sense_id": "b707161f-ee92-391e-b82e-9efc5a51058a",
                                                "text": "„Aber die moderne Binsenweisheit vom »heliozentrischen Weltbild« war im 16. Jahrhundert ein mathematisch ausgeklügelter Irrsinn, der nicht nur der Heiligen Schrift widersprach, sondern auch dem gesunden Menschenverstand.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "790da675-1bb8-41d7-89b0-783f70024bf5",
                        "source_entry_id": "8cbcf11c-735d-3be8-b5f2-a811fc1c5389",
                        "source_sense_id": "aa9ad3eb-493f-3ab5-8b5c-1abb08f8d6df",
                        "target_lang_word": "lapalissade",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lapalissade",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3830e447-81ba-3f5c-81fc-c09ccc47c1f7",
                                        "entry_id": "ef104c8a-b042-365b-8f9b-a5c75092cef7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An obvious, self-evident truth, especially humorously so; a tautology or truism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76e4a065-7ca0-4282-9981-7519e83299fb",
                                                "sense_id": "3830e447-81ba-3f5c-81fc-c09ccc47c1f7",
                                                "text": "In a certain way our theory is so obvious that it appears to us as a “lapalissade”. The cell is a network of phospholipid membranes and one of their chief functions is to keep certain substrates and enzymes apart."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92876314-2c06-4eea-bc79-a2fc72e716b3",
                                                "sense_id": "3830e447-81ba-3f5c-81fc-c09ccc47c1f7",
                                                "text": "Despite their affection for Gavarni, they dismissed as a lapalissade his oft-repeated statement that science had killed the notion of God"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c00343c3-1ce8-474a-8104-40dd1173571c",
                                                "sense_id": "3830e447-81ba-3f5c-81fc-c09ccc47c1f7",
                                                "text": "His display of the virtues Dickens has popularized is a real fraud. Nothing can show that he wants to abide by them. That he only loves himself is a lapalissade."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c6c7f128-ced5-47d5-9003-3182e7281942",
                        "source_entry_id": "8cbcf11c-735d-3be8-b5f2-a811fc1c5389",
                        "source_sense_id": "aa9ad3eb-493f-3ab5-8b5c-1abb08f8d6df",
                        "target_lang_word": "truism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "truism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "16c8f05a-61d6-34c9-97c0-37b4ac8452c4",
                                        "entry_id": "837e77c5-8a1b-3794-8c44-41d295ca20c0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A self-evident or obvious truth."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e280703-8277-459b-9286-3caef9c6eec5",
                                                "sense_id": "16c8f05a-61d6-34c9-97c0-37b4ac8452c4",
                                                "text": "It is a truism that the people who attend a rally for President Trump more than two years before he’s on the ballot again are generally strong supporters of President Trump."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9790ede6-b841-4f83-a343-314e1a69655e",
                                                "sense_id": "16c8f05a-61d6-34c9-97c0-37b4ac8452c4",
                                                "text": "The phrase If something exists, there is porn of it used to be a clever internet meme; now it’s a truism."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "76330d39-baaf-3130-acb9-d09305228d58",
                                        "entry_id": "837e77c5-8a1b-3794-8c44-41d295ca20c0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A banality or cliché."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "319115f0-473b-4a15-b827-3ff75f646966",
                                                "sense_id": "76330d39-baaf-3130-acb9-d09305228d58",
                                                "text": "After a little decent sorrow had been put forth for the late \"severe affliction,\" joined with some weariful truisms about resignation to the will of Providence, the rest of the epistle was filled up with reproofs about her ladyship's extraordinary and improper conduct in setting off without his consent!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
